UID:1012353
DESCRIPTION:<p>Winner of the New York Drama Critics&rsquo\; Circle Award f
 or Best Play\, Bruce Norris&rsquo\;s profane\, disruptive\, and heartbreak
 ing <em>Downstate</em> finally arrives on Broadway in a strictly limited 1
 2-week engagement\, directed by three-time Tony Award winner Joe Mantello.
 <br /><br />Four men\, living together uneasily in the pressure-cooker of 
 a state-sanctioned group home\, have been convicted of sex crimes against 
 minors. They have served their prison sentences\, but enjoying the freedom
  they believe they have earned proves both elusive and treacherous. When a
  survivor unexpectedly arrives and demands to confront his abuser\, the en
 counter triggers a catastrophic chain reaction that cannot be contained.<b
 r /><br />Starring Cassie Beck\, K. Todd Freeman\, Francis Guinan\, Adrian
  Martinez\, Al&rsquo\;Jaleel McGhee\, Thomas Sadoski\, Ivy Wolk\, and Liza
  Col&oacute\;n-Zayas.</p>
